8,Komyandaret,https://lingweb.eva.mpg.de/channumerals/Komyandaret.htm,"Other comments: Komyandaret is spoken by approximately 300 speakers in Sungai river west bank headwaters, Papua province, Indonesia. Komyandaret may have a body tally system. New data needed.",Komyandaret,Trans-New Guinea
9,Change in Traditional Numerals Systems in Mian and other Trans New...,https://hal.science/hal-03598841/document,"This is in contrast to some other Trans New Guinea languages, for example Kalam and Oksapmin, in which the body-part system is still employed by older speakers. There is no evidence that the terms of the Mian body-part system have ever been used as numerals in the noun phrase.",Komyandaret,Trans-New Guinea
